(1)  625/    FB68 :                     		; These three instructions partially overwrite the inertia value in
(1)  626/    FB68 :                     		; 'd0'! This causes the character to trigger their skidding
(1)  627/    FB68 :                     		; animation at different speeds depending on whether they're going
(1)  628/    FB68 :                     		; right or left. To fix this, make these instructions use 'd1'
(1)  629/    FB68 :                     		; instead.
