   12797/   1A7A6 :                     ; This seems to be a subroutine that would've shifted the background blocks
   12798/   1A7A6 :                     ; of Chemical Plant Zone once the player reached a certain X position,
   12799/   1A7A6 :                     ; lasting exactly two screens. This can also be found in the final at
   12800/   1A7A6 :                     ; $40200 in the ROM, with the only difference being its level ID, which
   12801/   1A7A6 :                     ; was updated to match Chemical Plant's final ID ($0D instead of 02)
   12802/   1A7A6 :                     ;
   12803/   1A7A6 :                     ; To see the effect for yourself, add a branch to it at the
   12804/   1A7A6 :                     ; start of LoadTilesAsYouMove and change $FFFF7500/$FFFF7D00 to
   12805/   1A7A6 :                     ; $FFFF0000/$FFFF0800 (to make it more visible)
   12806/   1A7A6 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   12807/   1A7A6 :                     
   12808/   1A7A6 :                     ; ||||||||||||||| S U B R O U T I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
