   15908/   19BEA :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   15909/   19BEA :                     ; This seems to be a subroutine that would've shifted the background blocks
   15910/   19BEA :                     ; of Chemical Plant Zone once the player reached a certain X position,
   15911/   19BEA :                     ; lasting exactly two screens. This can also be found in the final at
   15912/   19BEA :                     ; $40200 in the ROM, with the only difference being its level ID, which
   15913/   19BEA :                     ; was updated to match Chemical Plant's final ID ($0D instead of 02)
   15914/   19BEA :                     ;
   15915/   19BEA :                     ; To see the effect for yourself, add a branch to it at the
   15916/   19BEA :                     ; start of LoadTilesAsYouMove and change $FFFF7500/$FFFF7D00 to
   15917/   19BEA :                     ; $FFFF0000/$FFFF0800 (to make it more visible)
   15918/   19BEA :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   15919/   19BEA :                     
   15920/   19BEA :                     ; ||||||||||||||| S U B R O U T I N E |||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||
