   15927/   19BF2 :                     
   15928/   19BF2 :                     .locret_1AC26:
   15929/   19BF2 : 4E75                		rts
   15930/   19BF4 :                     ; ===========================================================================
   15931/   19BF4 :                     ; this shifts all blocks of the chunks $EA-$ED and $FA-$FD one block to the
   15932/   19BF4 :                     ; left and the last block in each row (chunk $ED/$FD) to the beginning
   15933/   19BF4 :                     ; i.e. rotates the blocks to the left by one
